{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14712","headline":"荅东野夷门雪 · 陆长源","name":"荅东野夷门雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"好丹与素道不同，失意得途事皆别。\n东隣少年乐未央，南客思归肠欲绝。\n千里长河冰复冰，云鸿冥冥楚山雪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆长源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14712.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14712","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}